---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="AI Workflow Fit Call"
  description="Discuss the work you want to improve with Dr. Matthias Röder and identify the right Scan, Audit, Build, or workshop."
>
  <PageHero
    label="AI Workflow Fit Call"
    title='Bring the work that is <span class="text-ms-green-400">getting in the way.</span>'
    subtitle="In 30 minutes with Dr. Matthias Röder, we will discuss the work you want to improve and whether a Scan, Audit, Build, or workshop is the right next step."
  />

  <section class="bg-ms-dark-800 border-y border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16">
      <div>
        <p class="text-ms-green-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Book the fit call</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Talk through the opportunity</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">Bring a short description of the situation and the outcome you want. If you are still choosing where to begin, bring one business area and two or three candidate workflows. If you already have a selected workflow or a workshop need, start there.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8">No deck. No AI theatre. One useful decision.</p>
        <a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/0/appointments/schedules/AcZssZ0d06UdVYGpntqGPa2qeX6g2pFDn7oWhpv5WM-DLA81Mt3s9fqtVfccB5OYifk8sTANbKz1tnXr" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
          data-conversion="ai-workflow-fit-call" data-placement="contact-primary"
          class="block bg-ms-green-500 hover:bg-ms-green-400 text-ms-dark-900 px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-semibold text-lg transition text-center">
          Book a 30-minute fit call →
        </a>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Your confirmation includes a Google Meet link. Calls can be in English or German.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="text-ms-green-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Prefer writing?</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Send the situation</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-8">Tell us which part of the organization you want to improve, what repeats, where the friction sits, and what a better outcome would change.</p>
        <a href="mailto:info@themindshift.global?subject=AI%20Workflow%20inquiry"
          data-conversion="ai-workflow-enquiry-email" data-placement="contact-secondary"
          class="block border border-white/20 hover:border-white/40 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-semibold text-lg transition text-center">
          info@themindshift.global
        </a>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-500">We respond within 48 hours. Usually faster.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-ms-dark-900">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
      <p class="text-ms-green-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Still choosing a workflow?</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">The AI Workflow Scan is the usual starting point.</h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/5">
        <div class="bg-ms-dark-800 p-7"><p class="text-ms-green-400 text-sm font-semibold">SCOPE</p><p class="mt-3 text-white">One business area</p></div>
        <div class="bg-ms-dark-800 p-7"><p class="text-ms-green-400 text-sm font-semibold">FORMAT</p><p class="mt-3 text-white">Two focused sessions</p></div>
        <div class="bg-ms-dark-800 p-7"><p class="text-ms-green-400 text-sm font-semibold">OUTPUT</p><p class="mt-3 text-white">AI Workflow Recommendation</p></div>
      </div>
      <a href="/services/workflow-scan" class="inline-block mt-6 text-ms-green-400 font-semibold hover:text-ms-green-300 transition">See what the Scan includes →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
